Project-Context-Universal.md

# --- Terraform Exclusions ---

# Local directory containing provider plugins and modules (downloaded during terraform init)
.terraform/

# Terraform state files (contain current infrastructure configuration and potentially sensitive metadata)
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate.lock.info

# Variables files (often contain sensitive environmental data or secrets)
# We ignore *.tfvars. If you want to check in non-sensitive defaults, use .tfvars.example files.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Override files (local overrides that shouldn't be committed)
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# CLI configuration files
.terraformrc
terraform.rc